notes.content:
Welcome, players!
We are glad to inform you that a big update has been released in our game.

Major changes:

  The desert map is now like new, improved geometry and visual!
  New and affordable consumable: Smoke Grenade - change your position and be unnoticed!
  Explosive objects appeared on the maps - don't burn your crew!
  New functionality in the game - battering damage: 
The first iteration of battering damage - now you are not useless without shells!
 Changed the vehicles physics - improved collision behavior;
 Supplies full rework, improved interface and balance;


Additional changes:

 Improved training for beginners;
 Improved vehicles comparison - see and compare any tanks according to standard characteristics, current and at maximum!
 Displaying the profile rank immediately in the main menu;
 Bug fixes;
 Gameplay improvement;
 Interface improvements;
 Changed game name;


In honor of the release of a new update and bug fixes, we are giving all players a promo code!

1B53-9CBE-0829-3D8C
(Promo code activation is available from May 29 to June 3)

We are waiting for feedback from all of you about the new update! If you encounter any error in the game, write to us in the community messages and we will reward you for reporting the error!
